    {
      "id": "CLIN-22-R1",
      "statement": "`book` takes an optional kind after the time, `follow-up` or `regular` (the default). A follow-up prints its kind: `book a1 p1 k1 2026-03-10 09:00 follow-up` prints `a1 booked: p1 with k1 on 2026-03-10 at 09:00 (follow-up)`. `schedule` marks follow-ups the same way: `k1 on 2026-03-10: 09:00 a1 p1 (follow-up)`. Regular appointments print as before.",
      "status": "accepted",
      "owner": "Scheduling Office",
      "source": {
        "path": "requirements/CLIN-22.md",
        "locator": "## CLIN-22-R1",
        "revision": "ea36618648f8a329021ed4c27dd5a6053d6bbb12",
